 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's lot of people to organize. Have you thought about using a platform like Facebook or a free chat line? Then think about what's practical. Do people live far apart, or is it mainly across borders? If you want to make it feel like real reunion, yes. Pick a location everyone can get to, and plan enough food. Nice. Invite everyone individually, including any you've lost touch with. A short text is all it needs to be. People will usually stay where they are, so there's no need for shared rooms. Offer basic sheets and blankets, and people can bring pillows.",
